# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# This repository is PUBLIC. Source books are in copyright and must never be
# committed here — not the PDFs, not extracted text, not scans. The maps in
# this repo are original summaries that cite their sources; the sources
# themselves stay off the internet.
#
# These rules are a safety net, not the plan. The plan is that book files live
# outside this folder entirely.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Books and scans, in any form
*.pdf
*.epub
*.mobi
*.azw
*.azw3
*.djvu
*.chm
*.cbz
*.cbr

# Extracted / OCR'd source text
*extract*.txt
*apendice*
*appendix-full*
/sources/
/books/
/scans/

# Research notes that quote sources at length — keep these local
*deep-research*
*-notes-private.*

# OS and editor cruft
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store
*.swp
*~
.vscode/
.idea/

# Claude Code writes machine-local permissions and paths here. The repo is public;
# committed memory is deliberate, a machine's local settings never are.
.claude/settings.local.json
